</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/9713c00e-27c6-11f1-856b-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-03-24T035820Z-191002423-RC2S6KAG398W-RTRMADP-3-CHINA-MILITARY-OCEAN-MAPPING.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/9713c00e-27c6-11f1-856b-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-03-24T035820Z-191002423-RC2S6KAG398W-RTRMADP-3-CHINA-MILITARY-OCEAN-MAPPING.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">e4f6e818-82b2-11f1-8c3b-81a67be586d1</guid><pubDate>Sat, 18 Jul 2026 14:13:57 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/9713c00e-27c6-11f1-856b-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-03-24T035820Z-191002423-RC2S6KAG398W-RTRMADP-3-CHINA-MILITARY-OCEAN-MAPPING.jpg">via REUTERS - China Stringer Network</source><dc:creator>艾米</dc:creator></item><item><category>要闻解说</category><title>美涉港“紧急状态”不再续  未恢复其自治地位 亦未取缔李家超林郑等人制裁</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/%E8%A6%81%E9%97%BB%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%B4/20260718-%E7%BE%8E%E5%AF%B9%E6%B8%AF-%E7%B4%A7%E6%80%A5%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81-%E4%B8%8D%E5%86%8D%E7%BB%AD-%E6%9C%AA%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E5%85%B6%E8%87%AA%E6%B2%BB%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D-%E6%9C%AA%E5%8F%96%E7%BC%94%E6%9D%8E%E5%AE%B6%E8%B6%85%E5%8F%8A%E6%9E%97%E9%83%91%E7%AD%89%E4%BA%BA%E5%88%B6%E8%A3%81</link><description>
